        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at cogen 1MWe lean burn, allocation heat</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at cogen 1MWe lean burn, allocation heat
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in cogen 1MWe lean burn, allocation heat' delivers the coproducts 'heat, at cogen 1MWe lean burn, allocation heat' and 'electricity, at cogen 1MWe lean burn, allocation heat'.;
UUID: 6f50afa1-e935-34aa-8945-402b26fba44c
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation. Module "natural gas, high pressure, at consumer" is used; methane emissions from leakages due to distribution in low pressure network have been included (emission factor taken from Swiss module "natural gas, low pressure, at consumer, CH").
Location: Emissions and efficiencies adjusted to typical European conditions; extrapolated from German and Swiss emission regulations.
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f50afa1-e935-34aa-8945-402b26fba44c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
